		{"id":"dafbc5b8abbcd9a0","type":"text","text":"已知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  的前  $n$  项和为  $S_{n}$  若  $a_{n + 3} = a_{n} + 1$  ,且  $a_{1} = 1,a_{2} = 2,a_{3} = 3$  ,则  $S_{90} =$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 由  $a_{n + 3} = a_{n} + 1$  ,可知数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是个\"类周期数列\".因此可设数列  $\\{b_{n}\\}$  满足  $b_{n} = a_{3n - 2}+$ $a_{3n - 1} + a_{3n}$  ,则  $b_{n + 1} = a_{3n + 1} + a_{3n + 2} + a_{3n + 3} = a_{3n - 2}+$\n$1 + a_{3n - 1} + 1 + a_{3n} + 1 = b_{n} + 3$  ,于是数列  $\\{b_{n}\\}$  是公差为3的等差数列,且  $b_{1} = a_{1} + a_{2} + a_{3} = 6$  ,于是得到  $S_{90} = (a_{1} + a_{2} + a_{3}) + (a_{4} + a_{5} + a_{6}) + \\dots +$ $(a_{88} + a_{89} + a_{90}) = b_{1} + b_{2} + \\dots +b_{30} = 30\\times 6+$ $\\frac{30\\times 29}{2}\\times 3 = 1485.$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">答案</span> 1485","x":4471,"y":18020,"width":532,"height":340},
		{"id":"fa3dc5046a369762","type":"text","text":"等差数列$S_{n}$图像","x":2460,"y":18409,"width":274,"height":60},
		{"id":"d8edb7555016bf1c","type":"text","text":"构造新数列","x":1815,"y":18406,"width":196,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"e3e5882caf2c2e22","type":"text","text":"已知各项均为正数的数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是公比不等于1的等比数列,且  $a_{1}a_{2023} = 1$  ,若函数  $f(x) = \\frac{4}{1 + x^{2}}$  则  $f(a_{1}) + f(a_{2}) + \\dots +$ $f(a_{2023}) = \\_$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">解析</span> 数列  $\\{a_{n}\\}$  是公比不等于1的等比数列, $a_{1}a_{2023} = 1$  ,则  $a_{n}a_{2024 - n} = 1,n\\in \\mathbf{N}^{*},n\\leqslant 2 023$\n等比数列目标和性质由  $f(x) = \\frac{4}{1 + x^{2}}$  可得,当  $x\\neq 0$  时  $,f(x) + f(\\frac{1}{x}) =$ ${\\frac{4}{1+x^{2}}}+{\\frac{4}{1+({\\frac{1}{x}})^{2}}}=4,$\n关键\n于是  $f(a_{n}) + f(a_{2023 - n}) = f(a_{n}) + f(\\frac{1}{a_{n}}) = 4,$\n【大招识别1与首尾两端等距离的两项的和相等,采用倒序相加法求和\n令  $T_{2023} = f(a_{1}) + f(a_{2}) + \\dots +f(a_{2023})$\n则  $T_{2023} = f(a_{2023}) + f(a_{2022}) + \\dots +f(a_{1})$\n两式相加可得  $2T_{2023} = [f(a_{1}) + f(a_{2023})] + [f(a_{2}) + f(a_{2022})] + \\dots +[f(a_{2023}) + f(a_{1})] = 4\\times 2 023,$\n所以  $T_{2023} = 4046$\n\n<span class=\"fake-tag\">答案</span> 4046","x":3955,"y":18110,"width":449,"height":190},
