		{"id":"da2d4ee0448049e4","type":"text","text":"当n是偶数时,中间的一项C取得最大值","x":-16940,"y":24521,"width":299,"height":106},
		{"id":"432bdc8a5c2d1819","type":"text","text":"当n是奇数时,中间的两项  $\\mathrm{C}_{n}^{\\frac{n - 1}{2}}$  与  $\\mathrm{C}_{n}^{\\frac{n + 1}{2}}$  相等,且同时取得最大值.","x":-16940,"y":24681,"width":350,"height":160},
